<!-- Shared-field demo (fields-design 2c): open this in two browsers (or a
     normal + private window — DIFFERENT users, unlike the same-user tab
     test) and type. Everyone edits one document: type in different places
     at once and both edits survive; type in the same place and the
     characters interleave the same way for everybody. -->
<Vertical id="SharedNotesDemo" title="SharedNotes — one document for everyone">
  <Markdown id="sn_intro">
## Shared notes

This text is **shared across all users**: open the page as two different
users and both edit it at the same time. Nobody's sentence is overwritten
— the edits merge.
  </Markdown>
  <SharedNotes id="sn_notes"/>
</Vertical>
